  "term": "explosive disorder",
  "definition": "Explosive disorder, referred to here as Intermittent Explosive Disorder, is a mental disorder linked with anger. In this source, greater cumulative exposure to potentially traumatic events is associated with a higher risk of this disorder, especially in conflict-affected settings.",
